ency, and realistic garment behavior, ensuring the apparel looks true-to-life. Featuring stunning models and cinematic environments, the content delivers a premium visual experience tailored for modern brands.\n\nDesigned for ecommerce and D2C brands, this format is ideal for product listings, helping improve clarity, trust, and conversion by showcasing the product from every essential angle. Enhanced through advanced post-production processes like compositing, color grading, and upscaling, the final output is production-ready for listings, campaigns, and catalogues.\n\nV4B.ai enables brands to create high-quality kids-wear content at scale without physical shoots, reducing production costs by up to 80 percent while maintaining premium visual standards.\n\nEvery model, apparel, environment, animation, and detail is produced using our unique proprietary CGI, VFX & AI production pipeline powered by our high-end GPU computers, enabling brands to create high-end appliance ad films without studios, cameras, or live production. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video\n\n🔗 Learn more: https://www.v4b.ai\n📩 Business inquiries: grow@v4b.ai\n\nV4b.ai is an Agency creating Content & Videos Without Any Physical Shoot, using high-end GPU Computers powering CGI, VFX, and AI, operated by specialists. Our production-grade pipelines outperform prompt-based GenAI platforms, delivering cinematic Ad Films, eCommerce Videos, and more from Concept to Final Cut. \n\neCommerce/D2C Listing Videos - Most D2C buyers abandon eCom pages without completing a purchase as they aren’t convinced by images alone. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, then prod